Dear Team,

We are pleased to share an update to NexaCorp's Work From Home (WFH) policy effective from July 1, 2023. Please read the following changes carefully:

1. Employees may work from home up to 3 days per week (previously 2 days).
2. All remote work must be logged via the HR portal before 9:30 AM on the respective day.
3. Mandatory in-office days are Tuesday and Thursday for all departments.
4. Equipment requests for home office setup can be submitted through the IT helpdesk portal.

To acknowledge receipt of this policy update, please log in to the employee portal at:
https://portal.nexacorp.com/policy-ack

For any queries, reach out to hr@nexacorp.com or call extension 1102.

